{"id":63539,"date":"2026-08-25T15:15:44","date_gmt":"2026-08-25T14:15:44","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:37:52","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:37:52","slug":"trail-e-caminhada-rota-da-castanha-e-do-castanheiro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-e-caminhada-rota-da-castanha-e-do-castanheiro\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Rota da Castanha e do Castanheiro 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Rota da Castanha e do Castanheiro 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail e Caminhada Rota da Castanha e do Castanheiro 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na manh\u00e3 de s\u00e1bado, <strong>24 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, integrado na prestigiada <strong>Festa da Castanha de Sernancelhe<\/strong>, na Terra da Castanha, no distrito de Viseu. Promovida pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sernancelhe<\/strong> com o apoio dos Runners Sernancelhe e dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios, a prova convida os participantes a percorrer imponentes soutos centen\u00e1rios e paisagens outonais de beleza \u00edmpar.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o no <strong>Expo Sal\u00e3o Multiusos de Sernancelhe<\/strong> e chegada no Espa\u00e7o da Castanha e do Castanheiro, o evento disponibiliza o <strong>Trail Curto de 18 km<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada de 9 km<\/strong>. Todos os inscritos contam com abastecimentos de montanha com prova gastron\u00f3mica t\u00edpica, dorsal e medalha finisher (Trail), seguro desportivo, balne\u00e1rios com banho quente e op\u00e7\u00e3o do tradicional almo\u00e7o na cantina da Escola Profissional.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">24 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: c